> the only syntax that seems to work for freeing the latent means of HOF is to set both LV1~ and LV2~ to be 0 in both groups. This fits fine, but this does not seem right to me?

It is right.  You can't estimate both LV1 ~ 1 parameters under an equality constraint because that parameter is fixed to 0 in the first condition.  Thus, equating the second conditions LV1 ~ 1 implies you must also fix it to 0.

